  {
   "id": "concept2",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Half subtractor and full subtractor"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "A half subtractor finds $A - B$ for two bits: difference $D = A\\oplus B$ and borrow $B_o = \\bar{A}B$ (a borrow is needed only for 0 − 1). A full subtractor also takes a borrow-in: $D = A\\oplus B\\oplus B_{in}$ and $B_o = \\bar{A}B + B_{in}\\,\\overline{(A\\oplus B)}$."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Half subtractor: D = A ⊕ B, Bo = ĀB"
    },
    {
     "en": "Full subtractor: D = A ⊕ B ⊕ Bin"
    },
    {
     "en": "Bo = ĀB + Bin·(A ⊕ B)′"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "The difference bit of a subtractor is again an XOR. A borrow is needed only when we take 1 from 0, so the half subtractor borrow is A-bar B.",
    "kn": "ವ್ಯವಕಲಕದ ವ್ಯತ್ಯಾಸ ಬಿಟ್ ಕೂಡ XOR. 0 ಯಿಂದ 1 ಕಳೆಯುವಾಗ ಮಾತ್ರ ಎರವಲು (ಬಾರೋ) ಬೇಕು; ಅರ್ಧ ವ್ಯವಕಲಕದ ಬಾರೋ = ĀB."
   },
   "formula": "D = A\\oplus B, \\qquad B_o = \\bar{A}B"
  },
  {
   "id": "concept3",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Subtraction with 2’s complement"
   },
   "body": {
